            "([NH4].Flow[5] + [NO3].Flow[5]) as Leaching70cm",
            "",
            "sum of ([Soil].SoilWater.Flux[5] + [Soil].SoilWater.Flow[5]) from [Clock].StartOfSimulation to [Clock].Today as cumDrainage70cm",
            "sum of ([NH4].Flow[5] + [NO3].Flow[5]) from [Clock].StartOfSimulation to [Clock].Today as cumLeaching70cm"
