                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Comparing cultivars Coronet and PFR 100-05\n\n- Data collected by **Mike George**\n- Data sits in: https://iplant.plantandfood.co.nz/project/I161208\n\n## Context: \n- PFR 100-05 showed faster canopy cloure rates via drone aerial photos\n- Field trial was done to identify mechanisms. \n\n##Main differences between cultivars were:\n\n- Larger leaves by PRR 100-05 (45-80% larger)\n- Taller stems by PFR 100-05 (50% taller)\n\n## Observations\n\n- We agreed to keep only leaf size as genotype difference. Height also differed as:\n- [#Structure].HeightModel.PotentialHeight.XYPairs.Y = 13,204,820,820\n- [#Structure].HeightModel.PotentialHeight.XYPairs.Y = 20,300,1200,1200\n\n## Modifications (by RC, RZ, EK)\n- Changed sowing depth to 40 mm to delay emergence\n- Changed depth at which fertiliser N was applied to 10 cm (initially 40 cm which was an error)\n- Removed the initialisation of the second leaf\n- Changed maximum leaf area to match observations (cultivar-specific)\n- Changed tillering dynamics (cultivar-specific)\n- Changed phyllochron to improve leaf tip appearance (cultivar-specific)\n- Changed the extinction coefficient (cultivar-specific)\n- Changed stem height for a closer fit with measured values\n- Changed stem maximum N conc\n\n",
                  "Name": "ReadMe",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
